<title>BELGIUM: Boeing has made no new EU offer on McDonnell deal.</title>
<headline>Boeing has made no new EU offer on McDonnell deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing Co has made no new offer since Tuesday afternoon to win European Union approval for its merger with McDonnell Douglas, increasing the chances that the deal could be banned in Europe.</p>
<p>&quot;We have not put in any new offer,&quot; Boeing's vice-president for European affairs Jim Frank told Reuters.</p>
</text>
